# PROPOSAL — DO NOT APPLY (audit-and-propose exercise; no substrate writes)
#
# Target resource : https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/.well-known/solid  (storage description)
# Predicate       : rdfs:seeAlso
# Problem         : two seeAlso targets 404 — leftovers from the wiki container rename
#                     /wiki/pages/   -> renamed to /wiki/concepts/   (404 now)
#                     /wiki/sources/ -> merged into /wiki/concepts/   (404 now)
# Live containers  : /wiki/{concepts,people,places,events,organizations,procedures,working}/
#
# NOTE: the storage description is documented as fully static via Components.js
#       (void-description.json) — PATCH returns 405 (see MEMORY.md). This N3 Patch
#       is the LOGICAL repair; the real fix is editing the static config source.
#       See proposal 04 for the config-file edit. This patch is illustrative.
#
# Recommended new seeAlso set: drop the two dead paths; add /wiki/concepts/ (the
# rename target, which currently has NO seeAlso entry at all). people/procedures/
# working already listed; places/events/organizations are routed via Type Index and
# were never in seeAlso, so leaving them out preserves existing scope.

@prefix solid: <http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/terms#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

_:patch a solid:InsertDeletePatch ;
  solid:deletes {
    <../> rdfs:seeAlso <../wiki/pages/> , <../wiki/sources/> .
  } ;
  solid:inserts {
    <../> rdfs:seeAlso <../wiki/concepts/> .
  } .
